## About This Release

This release is a rebuilt version based on the original source code of (Ultra NX)[https://github.com/Ultra-NX/UltraNX].

This Atmosphère package includes several additional modules that are not included in, or are otherwise unavailable from, the original source.

It is intended for users who want a ready-to-use setup with a comprehensive set of essential features, but may not be familiar with how individual modules work or how to configure them correctly. This helps reduce the risk of accidentally installing or configuring incompatible components that could cause issues with Atmosphère.

